# Static kernel power policy for the desktop; see docs/power.md, program step 6.
# PCIe ASPM with L1 substates. The kernel refuses the write, which tmpfiles then ignores, when the firmware kept ASPM
# control or the machine booted with pcie_aspm=off, and its per-device quirks still exclude links known to break.
w- /sys/module/pcie_aspm/parameters/policy - - - - powersupersave
